<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak real Aug ind output falls 1.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak real Aug ind output falls 1.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output fell 1.5 percent, year-on-year, in August, after a 5.5 percent year-on-year increase in July, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Aug '96    July'96    Aug '95</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	     -1.5	  +5.5	 +10.4</p>
<p>Construction Output</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	     +2.7	  +8.1	  +4.8</p>
<p>Note. All changes are in real terms.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
